<view class="page"><view class="notice">订单、收款和课时相互独立：创建订单不会立即加课，只有全额收款后才通过lessonLedger发放课时。</view><view class="loading-state" wx:if="{{loading}}">加载中...</view><block wx:else><view class="admin-links" wx:if="{{role === 'admin'}}"><button size="mini" bindtap="finance">经营看板</button><button size="mini" bindtap="products">产品管理</button></view><view class="blocked card" wx:if="{{role === 'coach'}}">教练只能查看课时不足提醒，不显示订单金额、家长消费、收款方式或退款记录。</view><view class="section-title">{{role === 'coach' ? '课时不足提醒' : '续费预警'}}</view><view class="card alert" wx:for="{{alerts}}" wx:key="id"><image wx:if="{{item.avatarUrl}}" src="{{item.avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="fallback">{{item.name[0]}}</view><view class="grow"><view class="name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted small">{{item.classNames || '未分班'}}<text wx:if="{{item.guardianName}}"> · {{item.guardianName}}</text></view></view><view class="balance {{item.level === 'EMPTY' ? 'empty-balance' : ''}}">{{item.remainingLessons}}节</view><button wx:if="{{role === 'admin'}}" size="mini" data-student="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openForm">建单</button></view><block wx:if="{{role !== 'coach'}}"><picker wx:if="{{role === 'parent' && students.length > 1}}" range="{{students}}" range-key="name" value="{{studentIndex}}" bindchange="studentChange"><view class="card picker-child">当前孩子：{{students[studentIndex].name}} <text>切换 ›</text></view></picker><button class="btn-primary" wx:if="{{students.length}}" bindtap="openForm">购买课程产品 / 创建订单</button><view class="section-title">{{role === 'parent' ? '我的订单' : '全部订单'}}</view><view class="card order" wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="order"><view class="between"><view><view class="name">{{item.productName}}</view><view class="muted small">{{item.studentName}} · {{item.orderNo}}</view></view><view class="tag {{item.status === 'PENDING' || item.status === 'PARTIAL_PAID' ? 'warning' : ''}}">{{item.statusLabel}}</view></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="between"><view>{{item.lessonCount}}节</view><view class="amount">¥{{item.payableAmount}}</view></view><view class="muted small mt">已收¥{{item.paidAmount}} · 已退¥{{item.refundedAmount || 0}} · {{item.createdAt}}</view></view><view class="empty card" wx:if="{{!orders.length}}">暂无订单</view></block></block></view><view class="mask" wx:if="{{showForm}}" bindtap="closeForm"></view><view class="sheet" wx:if="{{showForm}}"><view class="sheet-title">创建孩子专属订单</view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">孩子</text><picker range="{{students}}" range-key="name" value="{{studentIndex}}" bindchange="studentChange"><view class="picker">{{students[studentIndex].name}} · 当前{{students[studentIndex].remainingLessons}}节</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">课程产品</text><picker range="{{products}}" range-key="name" value="{{productIndex}}" bindchange="product"><view class="picker">{{products[productIndex].name}} · {{products[productIndex].lessonCount}}节 · ¥{{products[productIndex].price}}</view></picker></view><view class="field" wx:if="{{role === 'admin'}}"><text class="field-label">优惠金额</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{discountAmount}}" bindinput="discount"/></view><view class="notice small">订单绑定当前孩子，兄弟姐妹之间不共享订单或课时。</view><button class="btn-primary" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="create">创建待付款订单</button></view>
